        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:8",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "We gat our bread with the peril of our lives because of the sword of the wilderness.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 34
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:9",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Our skin was black like an oven because of the terrible famine.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:10",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "They ravished the women in Zion, and the maids in the cities of Judah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 36
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:11",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Princes are hanged up by their hand: the faces of elders were not honoured.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:12",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "They took the young men to grind, and the children fell under the wood.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:13",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "The elders have ceased from the gate, the young men from their musick.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:14",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "The joy of our heart is ceased; our dance is turned into mourning.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:15",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "The crown is fallen from our head: woe unto us, that we have sinned!",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 24
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:16",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "For this our heart is faint; for these things our eyes are dim.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 45
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:17",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "Because of the mountain of Zion, which is desolate, the foxes walk upon it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:18",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou, O Lord, remainest for ever; thy throne from generation to generation.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Lamentations 5:19",
        "book": "Lamentations",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
